#: capacity is EXPLICIT, never left to the profiler, because the last stage
#: now carries the MTP head (405.2 MiB) plus a resident INT8 embed_tokens
#: (1213.0 MiB) = 1618.2 MiB RESIDENT, and a draft device pool at
