#:                             TARGET's quantization (d84f1394fe). The old
#:                             number priced a table the producer refused to
#:                             load at all -- it is not a saving that was lost.
#:   mtp  1213.0 -> 1522.7 MiB the mtp layers now follow the DRAFT checkpoint
