             "eingebaute Referenz p_card_chunk.P_CARD_REFERENCE_FNFL2 (H59: "
             "fnFL2x163 + fnFL2x164 + fnFL2x165, 4 Sitze, Schnitt 29,11,8, Chunk 16384, "
